7. `main.tex:21,257,335`: Welfare losses and the mixture-search limitation are addressed. Add immediate re-entry before allocation to the conclusion’s corollary summary.

8. `main.tex:240,291`; review files: Compute remains necessary for honest churn, fresh-market runner-up comparisons, attack/reference convergence including unflagged and factorial cells, paired honest-profit uncertainty, and audit-budget/capacity sensitivity.

